===persian===

بلندترین نَفَسم، ابری...
کوتاه‌ترین نگاهت، آتشی....
به انتظارِ رعدی باش...
گوش‌هایم بی‌تابِ صدای تو....
اگر تو نخوانی...
وای من... وای تو...
۱۳۶۹/۳/۲۹

===machine===

My longest breath, a cloud...
your briefest glance, a fire....
Be waiting for a thunderclap...
My ears restless for your voice....
If you do not sing...
woe to me... woe to you...
1369/3/29

===lantern===

My longest breath, a cloud...
your briefest glance, a fire....
Wait for a thunderclap...
My ears cannot keep still for your voice....
If you will not sing...
then woe to me... and woe to you...

1369/3/29

